WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.022
The window-function ideas from Module 11 transfer directly to Spark S Q L.

00:00:06.022 --> 00:00:10.932
Partition by defines which rows belong to the same analytical group.

00:00:10.932 --> 00:00:14.572
Order by defines the sequence inside that group.

00:00:14.572 --> 00:00:18.127
The lag function can retrieve a previous value.

00:00:18.127 --> 00:00:23.137
The function spelled L E A D can retrieve the next value.

00:00:23.137 --> 00:00:27.246
Window frames support running totals and moving calculations.

00:00:27.705 --> 00:00:31.002
The new consideration is execution cost.

00:00:31.002 --> 00:00:39.707
Window functions may require Spark to redistribute and sort data so the correct rows are together and in the correct

00:00:39.707 --> 00:00:45.605
order. The analytical idea is familiar, but the distributed engine has more work to coordinate.
